    "detailed_description": "This is a turn-based command battle game where you face off against 11 bosses in consecutive battles. The only preparation players can make is choosing skills and jobs, with no level-based growth elements. Finding powerful combinations of skills and jobs is the key to victory. This game is focused on battles and does not include story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>3-Character Party System</strong>: Turn-based battles with a 3 vs 1 format<br></li><li><strong>Shared HP, SP, and Buffs</strong>: Manage resources across the entire party<br></li><li><strong>SP Management</strong>: SP required for skill use starts at 0 at the beginning of battles and recovers each turn<br></li><li><strong>Shield System</strong>: Both enemies and allies must break shields to damage HP<br></li><li><strong>Relics</strong>: Earn passive effects from relics obtained as battle rewards</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "This is a turn-based command battle game where you face off against 11 bosses in consecutive battles. The only preparation players can make is choosing skills and jobs, with no level-based growth elements. Finding powerful combinations of skills and jobs is the key to victory. This game is focused on battles and does not include story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>3-Character Party System</strong>: Turn-based battles with a 3 vs 1 format<br></li><li><strong>Shared HP, SP, and Buffs</strong>: Manage resources across the entire party<br></li><li><strong>SP Management</strong>: SP required for skill use starts at 0 at the beginning of battles and recovers each turn<br></li><li><strong>Shield System</strong>: Both enemies and allies must break shields to damage HP<br></li><li><strong>Relics</strong>: Earn passive effects from relics obtained as battle rewards</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is a turn-based command battle game where you face off against 11 bosses in consecutive battles. The only preparation players can make is choosing skills and jobs, with no level-based growth elements. Finding powerful combinations of skills and jobs is the key to victory.",
